WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.940
global catastrophe.

00:01.940 --> 00:08.280
He said that it will be irreversible as any nuclear holocaust would be.

00:08.280 --> 00:11.160
This is what they said at the United Nations.

00:11.160 --> 00:12.160
What happened?

00:12.160 --> 00:13.160
Here we are.

00:13.160 --> 00:18.380
Another UN official stated in 1989 that within a decade, entire nations could be wiped off

00:18.380 --> 00:21.860
the map by global warming.

00:21.860 --> 00:22.360
Not happening.

